I'm not sure whether it's possible to see the console logs on ShinyApps.io (Andy will have to answer that) but in my experience, the most common sources of errors at deployment time are 1) case sensitivity in filenames--case matters in Linux, but not on Windows, please check that any literal filenames in your R code match the exact filename on disk; and 2) encoding issues (though usually that doesn't result in "argument is of length zero").

